---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 38
    messageMargin: 24
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Authenticated client
    participant API as Prediction API
    participant Schema as Schema validator
    participant Models as Verified model cascade
    participant DB as Persistence
    participant Live as WebSocket manager

    Client->>API: POST /predict
    activate API
    API->>Schema: Validate canonical observation
    alt invalid schema
        Schema-->>API: Validation errors
        API-->>Client: 422 Unprocessable Entity
    else valid schema
        Schema-->>API: Ordered feature vector
        API->>DB: Check event ID
        alt duplicate event ID
            DB-->>API: Existing observation
            API-->>Client: 409 Conflict
        else new event ID
            API->>Models: Resolve route and run cascade
            alt incompatible model route
                Models-->>API: Compatibility error
                API-->>Client: 409 Conflict
            else prediction produced
                Models-->>API: Label, scores, and top-feature summary
                API->>DB: Commit observation, prediction,<br/>and optional alert atomically
                DB-->>API: Persisted identifiers
                API-)Live: Broadcast committed events
                API-->>Client: 201 PredictionResponse
            end
        end
    end
    deactivate API
